# Welcome screen WITH three recent sessions: seed them with three @pre
# runs whose titles mirror the design's recent list
# (docs/kiln-design-handoff/Terminal.dc.html line 45's "Recent sessions"
# block), then check the banner lists all three (internal/cli/tui.go
# recentSessionRows, capped at recentSessionRowLimit == 3).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/startup-recent.yaml
@smoke
@size 120x40
@pre -p "fix the upload timeout"
@pre -p "add the retry loop"
@pre -p "clean up the test fixtures"

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome-recent-sessions
EXPECT /Recent sessions/
EXPECT /clean up the test fixtures/
EXPECT /add the retry loop/
EXPECT /fix the upload timeout/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
